  ('grimoire_2024_owlfolk', 'Owlfolk', '{"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Owlfolk are feathered people with round, watchful eyes and faces shaped like an owl''s, but bodies built much like anyone else''s. They gather where knowledge gathers: libraries in old forests, observatories, the back rooms of scribes'' halls. They keep late hours, speak softly and listen far better than they talk."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Their plumage follows their lineage, from snowy white to barred tawny brown. Long flight feathers line the back of each arm, so a raised arm opens into a broad, silent wing while the hand stays free; most wear coats with open sleeves. An owlfolk who trusts you will share almost anything they know; one who does not will remember everything you said."}]}]}', 'medium', '{"walk": 30, "fly": 30}'::jsonb, null, '[{"name": "Moonlit Eyes", "description": "{\"type\": \"doc\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"You have Darkvision with a range of 120 feet.\"}]}]}"}, {"name": "Soft Plumage", "description": "{\"type\": \"doc\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"You have proficiency in the Stealth skill.\"}]}]}"}, {"name": "Hushed Wings", "description": "{\"type\": \"doc\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"You have a Fly speed equal to your walking speed. You can''t use this Fly speed while you wear Medium or Heavy armour.\"}]}]}"}, {"name": "Night Learning", "description": "{\"type\": \"doc\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"You know one cantrip of your choice from the Wizard spell list. Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for it (choose when you select this species).\"}]}]}"}]'::jsonb, array['Common', 'Sylvan']::text[], array['humanoid', 'me